CFItems.fullStatement:
Estimate and measure:  
length of an object to the nearest U.S. Customary unit (1/2 inch, inch, foot, yard) and metric unit (centimeter, meter); 
weight/mass of an object to the nearest U.S. Customary unit (pound) and metric unit (kilogram); 
and	liquid volume to the nearest U.S. Customary unit (cup, pint, quart, gallon) and metric unit (liter).
